# The hosted control plane (apps/web) is one product in this monorepo. Vercel needs that app and
# the shared package source it imports, and nothing else — not the other products, not local build
# state, and above all not the secrets.
#
# Set the project's Root Directory to `apps/web` in the Vercel dashboard; this file only decides
# what gets uploaded, not which app gets built.

.git/
.github/
.nova/
.vercel/
.convex/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/target/
**/.next/
coverage/
playwright-report/
test-results/
tmp/
bench/
docs/
reliability/
services/
tooling/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.tsbuildinfo
*.log
